    ],
    "reviewed_sizes": [
      16,
      20,
      24,
      32,
      48,
      64
    ],
    "conclusion": "在本轮受控降采样中，16～20像素整图输入的评分虽有改善，五张展示样本仍主要是模糊形状，不能可靠看清细节。32像素开始较容易辨认整体飞机轮廓，48～64像素的机身、机翼轮廓改善更明显，适合作为下一步重点研究范围；发动机、尾翼等仍可能融合或变形。700张公开飞机中，微调模型从32像素起连续满足项目数值筛选，原模型从24像素起满足；内部60来源的干净输入，两者都到48、64像素才满足。因此不能认定存在统一的24或32像素下限。",
    "limitations": "这里的尺寸指整幅输入，飞机实际只占其中一部分。五张示例在64像素整图中，飞机近似包围框也只有约17～30像素宽。48～64是本轮值得继续验证的区间，不是保证清晰的门槛，更不是20倍真实光学细节恢复。公开700张只测试了受控双三次降采样；真实传感器噪声、模糊和压缩可能更难。当前原模型与微调模型视觉上接近；干净输入下原模型的平均PSNR略高，不能宣称微调全面胜出。",
    "visual_observations": {
      "001": "16/20 aircraft parts merge;32 outline emerges;48/64 wings and fuselage clearer but small structures incomplete.",
      "108": "16/20 ambiguity and wings/engines merge;32 recognizable planform;48/64 clearer but engine/tail shapes still simplified.",
      "172": "Larger target more recognizable by24/32;48/64 improved outline, details smoothed.",
      "433": "16/20 severe ambiguity;32 recognizable yet warped outline;48/64 improved but tail/engine structures imperfect.",
      "648": "Small target16/20 little beyond color blob;32 basic shape;48/64 outline improves but detail remains soft."
    }
  },
  "protocol": {
    "scoring": "Quantize model native x20 output toRGB8, then Lanczos to fixed HR reference grid; bicubic x20 baseline follows identical final resizing. Direct bicubic-to-reference also recorded. Exclude internal padding; shave8 reference pixels. SSIM RGB11window. EdgeMAE mean absolute gradient difference.",
    "interpretation": "Controlled synthetic downsampling, not native sensor GSD threshold. Current fixed-x20 pipeline is assessed after common-grid normalization; not proof of genuine20x optical resolution at every input size.",
    "source_dependence": "Internal60 held-out sources have been examined in earlier experiments; exploratory benchmark, not a new untouched confirmation set. RESISC45 all700airplane chips may share geographic scenes; image bootstrap does not establish independent geographic generalization.",
    "criteria": "Pointwise source-image bootstrap2000, not multiple-comparison corrected. Stable candidate: deltaPSNR anddeltaSSIM95%CI lower>0 andPSNRwin>=70%. Practical candidate additionally mean deltaPSNR>=0.2dB,deltaSSIM>=0.005,edgeMAE nonworse. Project screening conventions, not universal clarity standards. Any boundary requires visual review and at least2adjacent passing sizes."
  }
